; c03-hand12-last-trump. Anchor: shot-0043 (Ch. 3, Hand 12 after trick 1;
;   S-0043-b).
; Printed: certain: the partner or the left setter holds it.
; Claim: one trump is out, and the right setter, who threw the 1-0 on the
;   bidder's 6-6, cannot hold it.
; State: Hand 12, sixes trump, bid 36; the bidder (4-4 1-1 6-5 0-2 6-3 6-4)
;   led the 6-6 and saw the 6-1, the 6-0 and the 1-0. The 6-2 is out; the
;   right setter has shown void in sixes.
; Exact: 1, by the shown void (the left setter 1/2, the partner 1/2). Book
;   model: 1.
(include book)

(query
  (or (left-setter x) (bidders-partner x))
  (in t q*)
  (holds x t))
